---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ContactSection from "../components/ContactSection.astro";
const bullets = [
  {
    "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck size-5 text-primary-foreground\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>",
    "text": "Spedizioni rapide in tutta Italia e consegne dirette con mezzo aziendale"
  },
  {
    "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-leaf size-5 text-primary-foreground\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg>",
    "text": "Articoli ecosostenibili realizzati al 100% con plastica di seconda vita"
  },
  {
    "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes size-5 text-primary-foreground\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg>",
    "text": "Gamma completa di soluzioni standard e personalizzate per il cantiere"
  }
];
---

<Base
  title="Stampaggio ed estrusione per l'edilizia | Generalplast"
  description="Stampaggio a iniezione ed estrusione di articoli in plastica per l'edilizia civile e industriale, con plastica di seconda vita e imballi al 70% riciclati."
  ogTitle="Articoli in plastica per l'edilizia | Generalplast"
  ogDescription="Gamma completa di soluzioni standard e personalizzate per il settore civile e industriale."
  preload={["/estrusione.webp"]}
>
<main><section class="relative flex min-h-[60vh] items-end overflow-hidden pt-20"><img src="/estrusione.webp" alt="Linea di estrusione Generalplast" class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="480" height="640"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[image:var(--gradient-hero)]"></div><div class="container-page relative pb-16 pt-24"><p class="eyebrow text-primary-foreground/80">Prodotti edilizia</p><h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-extrabold uppercase leading-[1.05] text-primary-foreground sm:text-6xl">Stampaggio ed estrusione di articoli in plastica per l&#x27;edilizia</h1></div></section><section class="py-24"><div class="container-page"><p class="max-w-4xl text-2xl font-medium leading-snug">Il comparto produttivo dedicato all&#x27;edilizia unisce la tecnologia dello stampaggio a iniezione a quella dell&#x27;estrusione, permettendoci di offrire una gamma completa di soluzioni standard e personalizzate per il settore civile e industriale.</p><div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-md border border-border p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-[image:var(--gradient-accent)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-ruler size-5 text-primary-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.3 15.3a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 0 3.4l-2.6 2.6a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-3.4 0L2.7 8.7a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 0-3.4l2.6-2.6a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 3.4 0Z"></path><path d="m14.5 12.5 2-2"></path><path d="m11.5 9.5 2-2"></path><path d="m8.5 6.5 2-2"></path><path d="m17.5 15.5 2-2"></path></svg></span><h2 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">Stampaggio a iniezione</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Articoli e componenti in materiale termoplastico per sistemi edili.</p></div><div class="rounded-md border border-border p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-[image:var(--gradient-accent)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers size-5 text-primary-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg></span><h2 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">Estrusione</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Profili e articoli in continuo per l&#x27;edilizia civile e industriale.</p></div><div class="rounded-md border border-border p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-[image:var(--gradient-accent)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-recycle size-5 text-primary-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 19H4.815a1.83 1.83 0 0 1-1.57-.881 1.785 1.785 0 0 1-.004-1.784L7.196 9.5"></path><path d="M11 19h8.203a1.83 1.83 0 0 0 1.556-.89 1.784 1.784 0 0 0 0-1.775l-1.226-2.12"></path><path d="m14 16-3 3 3 3"></path><path d="M8.293 13.596 7.196 9.5 3.1 10.598"></path><path d="m9.344 5.811 1.093-1.892A1.83 1.83 0 0 1 11.985 3a1.784 1.784 0 0 1 1.546.888l3.943 6.843"></path><path d="m13.378 9.633 4.096 1.098 1.097-4.096"></path></svg></span><h2 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">Plastica seconda vita</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Materiale rigenerato e imballi al 70% di materiale riciclato.</p></div><div class="rounded-md border border-border p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-[image:var(--gradient-accent)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-5 text-primary-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><h2 class="mt-5 text-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">Qualità costante</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Controlli dimensionali e materiali certificati su ogni lotto.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-steel py-20 text-steel-foreground"><div class="container-page grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center"><div><p class="eyebrow">Sostenibilità</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold uppercase leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Attenti all&#x27;ambiente in ogni fase</h2><p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-steel-foreground/80">In un&#x27;ottica di economia circolare, Generalplast produce la sua intera gamma di articoli per l&#x27;edilizia utilizzando esclusivamente plastica di seconda vita e soluzioni di imballaggio realizzate al 70% con materiali riciclati.</p></div><img src="/catalogo.webp" alt="Catalogo prodotti Generalplast" class="w-full rounded-md object-cover shadow-[var(--shadow-strong)]" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="1050"/></div></section><section class="py-24"><div class="container-page text-center"><p class="eyebrow">Catalogo 2026</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold uppercase sm:text-4xl">Sfoglia il catalogo prodotti</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">Consulta la gamma completa di articoli in plastica per l&#x27;edilizia civile e industriale.</p><a href="https://anyflip.com/rswwi/uyga" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-sm bg-[image:var(--gradient-accent)] px-8 py-4 font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">Apri il catalogo</a><p class="mx-auto mt-6 flex max-w-2xl items-start justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-truck mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2"></path><path d="M15 18H9"></path><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14"></path><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"></circle></svg>Spedizioni rapide in tutta Italia con corrieri partner e consegne dirette con mezzo aziendale per le urgenze sul territorio.</p></div></section><ContactSection bullets={bullets} /></main>
</Base>
